'''Unidad''' ({{literal translation|Unity}}) is a [[W:Reformism|reformist]] [[W:Platformism|platform]] in the Baliscan Confederation, formed in 2022. It is considered to be the spiritual successor of the [[Reformist Bloc (Balisca)|Reformist Bloc]] after it's dissolution in the aftermath of the [[2021 Baliscan confederal election]]. 

